we are fortunate that under the joe  biden administration dr anthony fauci is  not holding back the actual science of  how things work and  of medical science and we know now  that during the trump administration  there was a friction  that made it to make it very understated  we could call it a friction  it made it so that there was a rift  between the  science of coronavirus and the trump  administration's position on coronavirus  since donald trump left we've been  hearing the science from dr  fauci and the white house has simply  been on board with that and that's a  very good thing  in this vein dr fauci yesterday or the  day before  responded to comments made earlier in  the week by fox news host tucker carlson  which we covered  where tucker suggested that parents who  make their children wear face coverings  are engaging in a form of child abuse  and that if you see a child wearing a  mask you should call  child protective services to report  child abuse the  entire rant was the delusional by tucker  here's just a little bit of it as a  reminder  if you dare to go on foot from union  station to the capitol for example in  washington without wearing a mask  angry biden voters will snort at you in  judgment how could you  they're saying from behind the gauze how  could you  that's the question we should be asking  of them in return  the rest of us should be snorting at  them first they're the aggressors  it's our job to brush them back and  restore the society we were born in so  the next time you see someone in a mask  on the sidewalk or on the bike path do  not hesitate  ask politely but firmly would you please  take off your mask  science shows there is no reason for you  to be wearing it your mask  is making me uncomfortable we should do  that and we should keep doing it until  wearing a mask outside is roughly as  socially accepted as  lighting a marble in an elevator it's  repulsive don't do it around other  people  that's the message we should send  because it's true as for forcing  children to wear mass  outside that should be illegal your  response when you see children wearing  masks as they play should be no  different from your response to seeing  someone beat a kid in walmart  call the police immediately contact  child protective services  keep calling until someone arrives what  you're looking at  is abuse it's child abuse and you are  morally obligated to attempt to prevent  it  if it's your own children being abused  then act accordingly  let's say your kid's school emailed you  to announce that every day after lunch  your sixth grader was gonna get punched  in the face by a teacher  how would you respond to that that's  precisely how you should respond when  they tell you that your kids have to  wear masks on the soccer field  that is unacceptable it is dangerous and  we should act like it because it is  but too few of us have responded like  that so dr fauci was asked about this  and he responded in very clear  and incredibly certain terms  take a listen you know i think that's  self-evident that that's  bizarre uh jim i i don't want to get  into a back and forth  with tucker carlson but i mean it's just  almost self-evident you're talking about  child abuse really come on  now the problem of course is that  anybody who believes tucker to begin  with  is not likely to care what dr fauci says  i've spoken to many teachers because i  have many  friends that are teachers and they told  me you know the last thing we need right  now when we're trying to get  back to teaching is child protective  services  being called by fox news viewers because  the kids are wearing masks  if we are to think of the kids that's  not good for the kids  and then the other thing i've noticed is  kids really don't seem bothered by the  masks like i hate the masks i of course  wear them  but i don't like wearing a mask it's not  particularly comfortable  now that they're not required outdoors  as a vaccinated person i'm no longer  wearing them outdoors but the kids i see  with them and friends who have kids  and they talk to me about it they all  say the kids don't mind it at all  we seem to find it as adults we seem to  find the masks more annoying  than the children i would actually argue  that subjecting children  to tucker carlson's rants is way closer  to abuse than simply wearing a mask  at school and consider the position that  dr fauci has now been in for more  than a year he is a doctor specializing  in immunology  during a global hundred year pandemic  and he ends up thanks to the trump  administration  uh and of sycophants like those uh of  of fox news fame dr fauci ends up in the  position of having to go on tv  to try to disabuse people of the  propaganda that comes  from the former administration dr fauci  goes on tv and has to try to disabuse  people  of tucker carlson's nonsense  disinformation remember that  fox news lawyers stated during a defense  of tucker carlson in a legal complaint  quote no reasonable person would take  tucker carlson  literally it is entertainment it is not  news he uses hyperbole he uses  exaggeration  and it's quite similar to the alex jones  defense of you can't go after alex jones  for things that he says on his show  because he is essentially playing a  character on his show  and certainly no one should take it  seriously jones  or tucker carlson but there are a lot of  unreasonable  people who watch tucker and do believe  it's a news show now my last thought on  this  merely as a curiosity as a thought  experiment  what would happen if someone called  child protective services or even 9-1-1  and said  i'm calling to report that children are  being forced to wear masks  does anyone show up in certain  situations police have to show up if you  call with a certain complaint and then  say  sorry cancel it there are certain types  of things where police have to just go  and check things out  if you call and say children are wearing  masks would anyone even listen to you  or is tucker's suggestion if followed  just destined to be ignored by child  protective services now the other  strange thing about the anti-masters  is that many of them believe covid is a  lab-made bio weapon from china  if you really believed that covid was a  bioengineered bioweapon from china  why the hell wouldn't you be wearing a  mask that again is an example of where  a lot of these anti-science beliefs  conflict when you put two of them  together needless to say  hopefully not that much longer that dr  fauci will need to be on tv refuting  this nonsense maybe that's that's  optimistic thinking i don't know one of  our sponsors today  is sheath underwear the weather is  warming up and as many of us know  that can be associated with sticking  rubbing  chafing with traditional underwear  sheath underwear creates boxer briefs  that solve it  all sheath underwear was developed by a  u.s soldier who spent time deployed in  the desert  he was looking for a way to be more  comfortable and he designed something  that's great  even just for everyday use sheath boxer  briefs have multiple  ergonomic compartments in front  to prevent skin on skin contact keeping  everything  separate cool dry and comfortable so  sheath underwear  will prevent the sweatiness and the  chafing and the readjusting  and sheath underwear is giving the david  pakman show audience  20 off when you go to sheath underwear  dot com slash  pacman and use the promo code pacman my  experience with sheath underwear  has been great yours will be as well if  you give it a try the link is right  underneath this video don't forget to  use that promo code pacman  for 20 off

